{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1168","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1168","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1168\",\"parent_revision\":\"885cdf3f698b4ae5d8871098fdc0caf5b707535846d67f62f7e48cf918b93cda\",\"root_revision\":\"885cdf3f698b4ae5d8871098fdc0caf5b707535846d67f62f7e48cf918b93cda\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n`plugin_validator.py` (4190 lines) copy-pastes frontmatter\\nvalidation logic from `validate_frontmatter.py` (1341 lines) instead of\\nimporting it. Comments acknowledge this: 'PYDANTIC FRONTMATTER MODELS (from\\nvalidate_frontmatter.py)' and 'Complexity preserved from validate_frontmatter.py\\nfor behavioral parity.' This creates two maintenance surfaces: any change must\\nbe applied to both scripts (as seen when reversing the name-field bug workaround).\\n\\n**Required work:**\\n1. Audit both scripts for all\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **consolidate validate_frontmatter.py into plugin_validator.py** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Frontmatter validation bug-fix session 2026-02-20\\n- **Priority**: completed\\n- **Added**: 2026-02-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-02)\\n\\n### Expected Behavior\\n\\nA single shared module `frontmatter_core.py` owns all Pydantic frontmatter models and extraction helpers. Both `validate_frontmatter.py` and `plugin_validator.py` import from it rather than duplicating logic. Any change to validation models is made once and propagates to all callers.\\n\\n### Desired Structure\\n\\nTarget state (already achieved as of 2026-02-20, commit bfb03f1):\\n\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/frontmatter_core.py` \u2014 shared library module containing Pydantic models (`SkillFrontmatter`, `AgentFrontmatter`, `CommandFrontmatter`), `extract_frontmatter()`, `get_frontmatter_model()`, `fix_skill_name_field()`, and shared constants.\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/plugin_validator.py` \u2014 imports `frontmatter_core` via `sys.path` insertion; no duplicated Pydantic models.\\n- `validate_frontmatter.py` \u2014 no longer present in `plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/`. The file does not exist at the path referenced in the original backlog description.\\n- `plugin_validator.py` has since been superseded by `uvx skilllint@latest check` per CLAUDE.md (scripts inventory entry: 'Removed \u2014 replaced by uvx skilllint@latest check').\\n\\nNo callers import `validate_frontmatter.py` from Python code \u2014 all references found in codebase are in planning docs and historical markdown only.\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n1. `plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/validate_frontmatter.py` does not exist \u2014 VERIFIED: file absent from scripts directory.\\n2. `plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/frontmatter_core.py` exists and exports `SkillFrontmatter`, `AgentFrontmatter`, `CommandFrontmatter`, `extract_frontmatter`, `get_frontmatter_model`, `fix_skill_name_field` \u2014 VERIFIED: file present, docstring confirms public API.\\n3. `plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/plugin_validator.py` imports from `frontmatter_core` \u2014 VERIFIED: lines 76-85 show `from frontmatter_core import ...`.\\n4. No Python file in the repository imports `validate_frontmatter` \u2014 VERIFIED: grep finds zero Python import statements referencing it.\\n5. Pre-commit hook does not reference `validate_frontmatter.py` \u2014 VERIFIED: `.pre-commit-config.yaml` contains no such reference.\\n\\n### Resources\\n\\n| Type | Item |\\n|------|------|\\n| Prior work | plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/frontmatter_core.py |\\n| Prior work | plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/plugin_validator.py |\\n| Prior work | plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/frontmatter_utils.py |\\n| Historical | plugins/plugin-creator/planning/plugin-validator-architecture.md |\\n| Historical | .claude/original-backlog-register.md (lines 147-178) |\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n\\n- Depends on: None\\n- Blocks: None\\n\\nNote: `plugin_validator.py` itself has been superseded by `uvx skilllint@latest check` (per plugin-creator CLAUDE.md scripts inventory). A separate backlog item may exist for tracking skilllint as the canonical validator.\\n\\n### Blockers\\n\\nNone. Work is complete. This item should be resolved.\\n\\n### Effort\\n\\nAlready done \u2014 Small (completed 2026-02-20, commit bfb03f1 on branch claude/fix-frontmatter-validation-u2iV2).\\n\",\"digest\":\"d8ac87512e625ef4ce2bc3023ca53499696612b804a07a11af6f689d0540331b\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVWQn8Q\"}"}